# Things that must never go into the published repository.
# GitHub Pages serves everything committed, and git keeps every version forever,
# so one big working file committed once stays in the history for good.

# working files for the drawings and videos; only the exported results belong here
*.aep
*.psd
*.ai
*.prproj
*.blend
*.zip
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# the raw camera originals, if they are ever copied in by mistake
*.raw
*.dng
*.cr2
*.nef
*.arw

# editor and system leftovers
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
